{"id":"1bb65160feb13df8","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-complete-theory.md","title":"Complete Theory","display":"df-complete-theory — Complete Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-complete-theory","aliases":["93-df-complete-theory"],"display":"df-complete-theory — Complete Theory","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-complete-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-complete-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-theory — Complete Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L\">\\(\\mathsf L\\)</span> is a candidate pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:F\\to F\">\\(N:F\\to F\\)</span> is the explicitly supplied negation operation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}\\)</span> is the sourced finitary structural-logic predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here relative to both the displayed logic and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}(T;\\mathsf L,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\land N:F\\to F\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\subseteq F\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in F\\;(T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\psi\\to\\psi\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\varphi\n\\lor T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}N(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}(T;\\mathsf L,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\land N:F\\to F\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\subseteq F\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in F\\;(T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\psi\\to\\psi\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\varphi\n\\lor T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}N(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Completeness is deductive closure plus decisiveness relative to one explicit logic and one explicit negation operation. Changing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> can no longer change the meaning of an unchanged predicate instance.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"N:F\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}(T;\\mathsf L,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\land N:F\\to F\\\\\n&\\land T\\subseteq F\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in F\\;(T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\psi\\to\\psi\\in T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\varphi\n\\lor T\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}N(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc3498f98607795c","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-maximal-theory]], [[93-df-consistency]], and [[93-df-complete-theory]]."},{"id":"882ddfff5f1c7a82","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea98968ac191af8c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-complete-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["bd7e4207897c8db3"]}